\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =8\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{4}) \\\\  & =8\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\  & =4\\sqrt{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the Cartesian coordinates of $B$ are $(4\\sqrt{2},4\\sqrt{2}).$" 13194139533918 true] [17592186265888 1000 #edb/ref 17592186265889 13194139533918 true] [17592186265888 1000 #edb/ref 17592186265890 13194139533918 true] [17592186265888 1000 #edb/ref 17592186265891 13194139533918 true] [17592186265888 1000 #edb/ref 17592186265892 13194139533918 true] [17592186265888 1000 #edb/ref 17592186265893 13194139533918 true] [17592186265888 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533918 true] [17592186265888 1041 "selection" 13194139533918 true] [17592186265888 1104 #edb/ref 17592186265889 13194139533918 true] [17592186265888 1110 #uuid "4a8de227-8472-5c81-ab7b-830ec478a832" 13194139533918 true] [17592186265889 1034 "(4\\sqrt{2},4\\sqrt{2})" 13194139533918 true] [17592186265889 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533918 true] [17592186265889 1111 #uuid "4325b6f4-81a3-52d0-9d82-c6657defe646" 13194139533918 true] [17592186265890 1034 "(8\\sqrt{2},8\\sqrt{2})" 13194139533918 true] [17592186265890 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533918 true] [17592186265890 1111 #uuid "7da24958-c102-5419-802f-6adc6f1cd558" 13194139533918 true] [17592186265891 1034 "(4\\sqrt{3},4\\sqrt{3})" 13194139533918 true] [17592186265891 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533918 true] [17592186265891 1111 #uuid "c582e450-fd13-5f62-8885-2162059c2da3" 13194139533918 true] [17592186265892 1034 "(2\\sqrt{2},2\\sqrt{2})" 13194139533918 true] [17592186265892 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533918 true] [17592186265892 1111 #uuid "1074de6c-fc5b-5bc2-b180-1d1afa758926" 13194139533918 true] [17592186265893 1034 "(8\\sqrt{3},8\\sqrt{3})" 13194139533918 true] [17592186265893 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533918 true] [17592186265893 1111 #uuid "20130431-0d2d-531e-b8c8-ee3f7bbcff6f" 13194139533918 true] [17592186265894 1017 #edb/ref 175921862